description:
Hi Service desk,
Please create a ticket for TradesII - intermittent TRIM-related issues

Hi Nigel,
Could you please investigate the TradesII - intermittent TRIM-related issues?
We are intermittently receiving the following messages from CM, which are causing delays in uploading files to TRIM and, consequently, impacting business processes.

